bm-render is a port to Zig / WebAssembly of takumi (https://github.com/kane50613/takumi):

    takumi
    Copyright (c) 2025 Kane Wang
    Licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.

Large parts of bm-render are transliterations of takumi's Rust code (layout, painting, text, CSS,
Tailwind, HTML, SVG, animation, codecs); bm-render is therefore a derivative work of takumi, uses
takumi under the MIT option of its dual license, and keeps its copyright notice in LICENSE.

takumi in turn follows Chromium's Blink renderer and Skia in many places, and bm-render ports or follows
further third-party code, algorithms and data. The notices they require are reproduced in
